        // A subject's grade.job_dead rows alone: the probe of the dead-job check (server/payouts/onchain.ts
        // cutDeadGradeJobSql, awaitingGrade's; grader/worker.ts createDeadGradeJobPager's sweeps). Off
        // audit_event_subject_idx that probe reads every audit row of the entry (6.2 a probe, up to 136, on prod's replica
